      "dcterms:issued": "D:20130904",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1309.0865",
      "dcterms:abstract": "The monoidal category of Soergel bimodules is an incarnation of the Hecke category, a fundamental object in representation theory. We present this cat- egory by generators and relations, using the language of planar diagrammatics. We show that Libedinsky’s light leaves give a basis for morphism spaces and give a new proof of Soergel’s classiﬁcation of the indecomposable Soergel bimodules.",
